.TH MINITI 1 "September 2026" "miniti 0.6.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
miniti \- AI meeting assistant with live transcription, insights and coaching
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B miniti
.RI [ \-\-hidden ]
.RI [ \-\-start\-meeting ]
.RI [ URL ...]
.br
.B miniti
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
With no command,
.B miniti
opens the desktop app. If one is already running it is raised instead, and any
.I URL
arguments (OAuth returns such as
.BR miniti\-google:// )
are handed to it.
.PP
With a command,
.B miniti
talks to the running app over its control socket and exits. The same state is
available as a JSON file and on the session bus (see
.BR FILES ).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-hidden
Start with the main window hidden; only the tray icon shows. Used by the
launch\-at\-login entry.
.TP
.B \-\-start\-meeting
Start a meeting as soon as the app is ready.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Print machine\-readable JSON instead of text (valid with every command).
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print help. Add a command to see its options.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR status " [" \-\-waybar ]
Recording state, elapsed time, live questions and any pending prompt. With
.B \-\-waybar
print one line of JSON for a Waybar custom module (fields
.IR text ", " tooltip ", " class ", " alt ", " percentage ).
.TP
.BR start " [" \fITITLE\fR ]
Start a meeting. Launches miniti if it is not running.
.TP
.B stop
Stop the meeting and save it.
.TP
.B toggle
Start if idle, stop if recording.
.TP
.B show
Raise the main window.
.TP
.BR open " [" \fIID\fR ]
Raise the main window on a saved meeting.
.I ID
defaults to
.BR last .
.TP
.B questions
Questions worth asking in the live meeting.
.TP
.BR meetings " [" \-n " \fIN\fR]"
List recent meetings (default 20).
.TP
.BR export " [" \fIID\fR "] [" \-o " \fIFILE\fR]"
Markdown export of a meeting (transcript, notes, insights, coaching) to
standard output or
.IR FILE .
.TP
.BR decide " " primary | secondary | tertiary
Answer the pending Smart\-meeting prompt (the buttons shown in the tray and on
the floating surface).
.TP
.B watch
Stream state changes as JSON lines until interrupted.
.TP
.B quit
Quit the running app.
.TP
.BR autostart " [" on | off ]
Show or change whether miniti starts at login
.RB ( ~/.config/autostart/miniti.desktop ).
.TP
.B paths
Where miniti keeps its files on this machine.
.TP
.BR completions " " bash | zsh | fish | elvish
Print a shell completion script.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
The app refused the request or it failed.
.TP
.B 2
Usage error.
.TP
.B 3
miniti is not running.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/miniti/prefs.json
Preferences.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/miniti/
Meeting database and device identity.
.TP
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/miniti/logs/
Daily rolling logs (seven days).
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/miniti/miniti.sock
Control socket: one JSON request per line, one JSON response per line.
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/miniti/state.json
Live state, rewritten atomically on every change. Watch it instead of holding
a socket open.
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/autostart/miniti.desktop
Launch\-at\-login entry.
.SH D\-BUS
Bus name
.BR com.miniti.linux ,
object
.BR /com/miniti/linux ,
interface
.BR com.miniti.linux.Control :
methods
.BR Status ", " Start ", " Stop ", " Toggle ", " Show ", " OpenMeeting ", " Decide ;
properties
.BR Recording ", " ElapsedSeconds ", " MeetingTitle ", " Version ;
signal
.BR StateChanged .
.PP
.EX
busctl --user call com.miniti.linux /com/miniti/linux com.miniti.linux.Control Toggle
.EE
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MINITI_SOCKET
Override the control socket path.
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Log filter (default
.BR info ).
.TP
.B MINITI_NO_LAYER_SHELL
Set to keep the floating surface a normal window on Wayland.
.TP
.B WEBKIT_DISABLE_DMABUF_RENDERER
Set to 0 to keep the DMA\-BUF renderer on NVIDIA (miniti disables it there by default).
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
miniti status --waybar
miniti start "Weekly sync"
miniti questions
miniti export last -o ~/notes/last-meeting.md
miniti watch --json | jq -r .elapsed_text
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
Full desktop\-integration notes:
.I /usr/share/doc/miniti/README.md
and
.IR https://github.com/12ian34/miniti-linux/blob/main/docs/desktop-integration.md .
.SH BUGS
.I https://github.com/12ian34/miniti-linux/issues
